				</ukm:Metadata><Secondary><Body DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2022/800/body/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2022/800/body" NumberOfProvisions="2"><P1group><Title>Lowering of the general speed limit for restricted roads</Title><P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2022/800/article/2/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2022/800/article/2" id="article-2">
<Pnumber>2</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2022/800/article/2/1/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2022/800/article/2/1" id="article-2-1">
<Pnumber>1</Pnumber>
<P2para><Text>The rate of speed fixed by section 81(1) of the Road Traffic Regulation Act 1984 (general speed limit for restricted roads) is reduced to 20 miles per hour.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2022/800/article/2/2/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2022/800/article/2/2" id="article-2-2">
<Pnumber>2</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>Accordingly, the reference in section 81(1) of that Act to “30 miles per hour” is to be interpreted as a reference to “20 miles per hour”.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
</P1para>
</P1></P1group></Body></Secondary></Legislation>